Gosh AppImage Manager is made by Gosh (Gosh Apps / Gosh-Its-Arch).

Gosh AppImage Manager 3.0.0 is an original Rust + libcosmic (COSMIC Epoch)
implementation. Gear Lever by Lorenzo Paderi
(https://github.com/mijorus/gearlever) is a GPLv3 behavioural reference
only. This project does not copy Gear Lever source, templates, CSS, icons,
screenshots, application ID, or branding, and is not endorsed by its authors.
